        },
        {
          "en": "That first ruler is Yaldabaoth. He had taken a great power from her when he came into being.",
          "es": "Ese primer gobernante es Yaldabaoth. Le había sacado un gran poder cuando llegó a existir."
        },
        {
          "en": "That power was light from the Fullness, the world of light above.",
          "es": "Ese poder era luz de la Plenitud, el mundo de luz de arriba."
        },
        {
          "en": "And now it was down below, inside him, in the world of the rulers.",
          "es": "Y ahora estaba abajo, dentro de él, en el mundo de los gobernantes."
        }
